Subject: [PATCH 03/19] tests: Expect flipped transforms in the Display
 Settings

libkscreen has the four flipped transforms of wl_output (a mirroring about the vertical
axis, then the turn) and KWin applies them, but the page only offers the four turns.
The model should show the mirroring apart from the turn, keep it when the screen is
turned, and the change should reach KWin.

Assisted-by: Claude Sonnet 5.5
